<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb explosions in southern Thailand have injured police and triggered tighter border security and expanded intelligence efforts, while Thailand is negotiating aviation hub status and cross-border water-pollution mitigation with China. Cambodia is bringing the Thailand border dispute to ASEAN and other international forums, receiving US backing, and has detained Cambodians crossing a suspected minefield. Myanmar’s military leader accuses Thailand of facilitating illegal border trade, and a $3 million project will train 4,500 Myanmar refugees for Thai jobs. Malaysia is funding a RM200 million rail link to the border, and the UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOSl9xRTZDUlZ5MDR0MFJNUDVHbkJ6NTloNGNCNGFEZ2JkVXBjT0p3RmlObkg3dzNGd0ZGYkFKWXc0MjVKak9DY1FYNnhkUEg2UHg3WlZZMm5VdFZ6ZkFzY3RtTWhzcUhRYU4teFMzX1lRYTVWRy1wRDNNRlhsb0FpVWRMOHZ0UlM4NDZmOVc1NXQ2bWlXcmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNdERoMEZSWlJfVktMaE01ZDBSRUo2SnY5N0hXQ1VDQThoQnkzdTE2NmNHUjZaZ1k5THdRYzliREd4Yk5NVVVCWXZIZk4wdmY4cXBmTlBFdUhaR0FTTXp1cFM0b0JEenFUTXlYaTJwUExyOFNkMm52Y3hreE1QTF9OTzhJRHplSmw5ZTgyVGFiaHZZUEtFdnFMSmQ3MS1QM2gzSTE4UGhUU2JhVVRFRTJwWFlPVG93ZnpJeGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQWDdYLVdmcTB2dm1fR0xhUkdoNTltZlA4MlJrV0FXVVI0eXdISDdkWm4zTXBFMVl1RVcxQl9CZG1zOUk2WGJMYm1ydW9aX0hIWXh1ektuQjAtOF9kV0hwOG5xbGdKbHNUNEE2ZTRidmVnZzM3VDJ5SS1vaW5LbEZ6RV93?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizens Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cU